"and the result must have the same integer, vector-of-integer or matrix-of-"
"integer type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:338
msgid ""
"The optional `nsw` (no signed wrap) and `nuw` (no unsigned wrap) unit "
"attributes indicate that the result is poison if signed or unsigned overflow "
"occurs, respectively. The optional `sat` (saturated) attribute clamps the "
"result to the type's representable range instead of wrapping. The `nsw`/"
"`nuw` flags and `sat` are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""

