msgid "_Destroy array elements with C++ destructors_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:723
msgid ""
"Destroy each array element using the same C++ destructor. This operation has "
"one region with one block whose argument is a pointer to the current array "
"element."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:730
msgid ""
"When `num_elements` is present, `addr` is a pointer to the first element and "
"`num_elements` provides the runtime element count (e.g. from an array cookie "
"for `delete[]`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:734
msgid ""
