#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:824
msgid ""
"Operand attributes are a storage, where each element corresponds to the "
"operand with the same index. The first index relates to the operation result "
"(if any). The operands themselves are stored as VariadicOfVariadic in the "
"following order: output, input and then in/out operands. When several output "
"operands are present, the result type may be represented as an anonymous "
