msgid "The `volatile` keyword indicates that the operation is volatile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:3571
msgid ""
"The `skip_tail_padding` keyword indicates that only the data bytes should be "
"copied, excluding any tail padding. This is used when copying potentially-"
"overlapping subobjects where the tail padding might be occupied by other "
"objects (e.g. fields marked with `[[no_unique_address]]`). This is only "
"valid when the pointee type is a record type."
msgstr ""

