#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:10785
msgid ""
"There are case statements of the switch statement that are scope other than "
"the top level compound statement scope. Note that a case statement itself "
"doesn't form a scope."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:10788
